    "created_at": "2016-03-29T14:37:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T14:37:26Z",
    "body": "That example there does not illustrate a privacy or security issue and might instead illustrate a confusion between `value` and `defaultValue`. However, given the differences between browsers perhaps we should not special case the empty string value.\n\nWhich browsers did you test?\n",
